&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

hardyaka-payoneer:greenhouse:7810619.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role operates in mix between 1-1 with top clients and a 1-to-many, outbound-led model, managing a large customer portfolio through a combination of automation, lifecycle triggers, and targeted commercial engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage and grow large pool of existing client relationships, building long-term partnerships with top and mid-tail customers to identify emerging business needs and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively strengthen and expand relationships to maximize retention, cross-sell, and upsell across the portfolio, increasing customer value and revenue through tailored engagement strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform outbound outreach, including cold calls, identify opportunities, activate customers, and drive commercial outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute multi-channel strategies to reach large customer segments at the right moment in their lifecycle, creating and qualifying opportunities effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive retention, and cross-selling initiatives. Identify business opportunities and define go-to-market strategies, leveraging customer insights and market learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build success stories, case studies, and business reports to showcase impact and support internal and external alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead educational initiatives, including webinars and workshops, to drive ongoing engagement within the portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end commercial process, including demos, proposals, negotiations, and closing long-term agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree, preferably in business or engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and Ukrainian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of account management, sales, business development or other relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in developing business cases, financial analyses, and modeling, analyzing and forecasting economic and financial impacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to present a business case to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of organization, focus, and ability to work under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Points we need from you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· High-volume- outbound environment experience, comfortable handling large outreach volumes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Experience with CRM platforms like Sales Force and expertise in sales reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Familiarity with payment industry, ERP; invoicing, reconciliation tools and data-driven platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Proven track record in working with international clients across diverse industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Experience selling B2B solutions in a highly consultative manner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build each other up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping each other grow, as professionals and people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a business, a community, and a mission you want to be part of, apply today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing a diverse and inclusive workplace. Payoneer is an equal opportunity employer, and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment no matter your race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any stage of the hiring process, please speak to the recruiter managing the role for any adjustments. Decisions about requests for reasonable accommodation are made on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

hardyaka-payoneer:greenhouse:7881349.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Intern in Payoneer’s Business Development team, you will be part of a high impact, fast-growing commercial organization driving Payoneer’s expansion in China. This internship is designed as an early career pathway for developing future sales talent.‑impact, fast‑growing commercial organization driving Payoneer’s expansion in China. This internship is designed as an early‑career pathway for developing future sales talent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will gain first-hand experience in commercial engagement, customer management, and go to market execution in the fast-growing cross-border business. In this role, you will work closely with sales managers and sales admins across regions, explore new technologies, build strong presentation and communication capabilities, and develop practical skills that prepare you for a successful career in fintech sales.‑to‑market execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support BD and Sales Managers in commercial activities, including customer outreach, follow-ups, and engagement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in customer meetings, onsite visits, and business reviews to understand operational needs and Payoneer’s value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct analysis of sales pipelines, customer performance, and market trends to support decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with preparing presentation materials, product demos, and business proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross‑functional teams (Marketing, Product, Risk, Operations) to help execute GTM campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify new business opportunities, potential customer segments, and growth initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and understand emerging tools, AI technologies, and digital sales methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle day‑to‑day operational tasks related to customer handling and sales processes (without assistant labeling; full ownership encouraged)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal documentation, reports, and workflow improvements for the sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled university student who will graduate before September 2027 (senior undergraduate or current graduate student preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive, and willing to experiment in a fast‑changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills; comfortable engaging with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast learner with interest in fintech, cross‑border eCommerce, or digital technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with basic data skills (Excel, Sheets, BI tools are a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail‑oriented, organized, and capable of managing multiple tasks independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and a collaborative team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to commit to a 3–6 month internship (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
